1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
I'm your China Travel Expert.
我是你的中国旅游专家

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:04,000
Tourists break these 3 temple rules daily.
游客天天踩这3个寺庙规矩

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,400
#1 Never step on the wooden threshold.
第一：千万别踩木门槛

4
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:08,800
It's built to keep bad luck outside.
门槛是用来挡霉运的

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:11,200
#2 Don't walk through the center door.
第二：别走正中那道门

6
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:13,600
The middle gate is for the gods — take the right.
中门是神明走的，你走右门

7
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:16,000
#3 Never offer 4 incense sticks.
第三：上香别上四炷

8
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,400
4 sounds like "death" — offer 3.
"四"谐音"死"，要上三炷

9
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:20,600
Double-tap if you'd bow here.
想拜一拜的点个赞

10
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:23,200
★ Expert Tip: hold incense in both hands, raise to your forehead, bow 3 times.
双手举香至额前，鞠躬三次

11
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:26,000
Which one did you get wrong? Comments below.
你踩过哪一个？评论区见
